{
    "name": "CI - @apx-vero mention -> OpenClaw vero agent",
    "description": "When someone mentions @apx-vero on a pull request, starts the vero agent on the OpenClaw gateway, which answers every unanswered mention and updates the PR where asked.",
    "flow": {
        "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001": {
            "type": "appmixer.github.list.NewMention",
            "version": "1.0.0",
            "label": "@apx-vero mentioned",
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": true,
                "onError": "storeUnprocessed"
            },
            "config": {
                "properties": {
                    "repositories": "Appmixer-ai/appmixer-connectors"
                }
            },
            "x": 208,
            "y": 128
        },
        "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.controls.Condition",
            "version": "1.0.0",
            "label": "On a pull request",
            "errorHandling": {
                "autoRetry": true,
                "onError": "storeUnprocessed"
            },
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001": [
                        "out"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "transform": {
                    "in": {
                        "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001": {
                            "out": {
                                "type": "json2new",
                                "modifiers": {
                                    "expression": {
                                        "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001": {
                                            "variable": "$.a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001.out.subject.type",
                                            "functions": []
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "lambda": {
                                    "expression": {
                                        "AND": [
                                            {
                                                "OR": [
                                                    {
                                                        "input": "{{{b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001}}}",
                                                        "operator": "=",
                                                        "value": "PullRequest"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            "x": 400,
            "y": 128
        },
        "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004": {
            "type": "appmixer.utils.http.Post",
            "label": "Notify the OpenClaw vero agent",
            "x": 592,
            "y": 128,
            "source": {
                "in": {
                    "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002": [
                        "true"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "config": {
                "transform": {
                    "in": {
                        "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002": {
                            "true": {
                                "type": "json2new",
                                "modifiers": {
                                    "url": {},
                                    "headers": {},
                                    "bodyType": {},
                                    "body": {
                                        "b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004": {
                                            "variable": "$.a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001.out.subject.url",
                                            "functions": []
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "lambda": {
                                    "url": "https://91-99-144-37.nip.io/hooks/vero-mention",
                                    "headers": "{\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\", \"Authorization\": \"Bearer <OPENCLAW_HOOK_TOKEN>\"}",
                                    "bodyType": "raw",
                                    "body": "{\"pr_url\": \"{{{b2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004}}}\"}"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    },
    "notes": {
        "e2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001": {
            "x": 144,
            "y": -256,
            "width": 560,
            "height": 320,
            "content": "## @apx-vero mention -> OpenClaw vero agent\n\nCalls the `vero-mention` hook of the OpenClaw gateway when a person mentions the bot on a PR — in the conversation, inline on a diff line, or in a review body. The `vero` agent then runs the responder (`.github/openclaw/vero-mention/` in the connectors repo).\n\nA GitHub notification is one per PR thread, so the payload is only `{pr_url}`: the responder sweeps that PR for every mention with no reply yet and answers each once.\n\n**Source of truth:** `.github/appmixer-flows/apx-vero-mention-dispatch.json` in the connectors repo."
        },
        "e2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002": {
            "x": 144,
            "y": 256,
            "width": 560,
            "height": 272,
            "content": "### Account and hook token\n\n**New Mention** reads the notifications of the account it is bound to, so bind the **bot** (apx-vero) — its own mentions never notify it, which also rules out loops.\n\n**HTTP Post** carries the gateway hook token in its headers (wizard field \"OpenClaw hook headers\"). A 401 from the hook = wrong or rotated token; a 403 `proxy_attribution_required` = the gateway lost `trustedProxies`."
        }
    },
    "wizard": {
        "fields": [
            {
                "type": "account",
                "label": "Bot account (the one people mention)",
                "tooltip": "Its notifications are read to find mentions. Bind the bot, e.g. apx-vero.",
                "placeholder": "",
                "attrs": {
                    "service": "appmixer:github",
                    "components": [
                        "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
                    ],
                    "sharedAccountId": null
                },
                "options": {}
            },
            {
                "type": "inspectorField",
                "label": "Repositories to watch",
                "tooltip": "owner/repo, comma-separated. The OpenClaw hook only accepts pull requests of Appmixer-ai/appmixer-connectors; add a repository to its transform before watching it here.",
                "placeholder": "Appmixer-ai/appmixer-connectors",
                "source": "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001.config.properties.repositories",
                "attrs": {},
                "options": {}
            },
            {
                "type": "inspectorField",
                "label": "OpenClaw hook headers",
                "tooltip": "Headers for the call to the OpenClaw vero agent. Replace <OPENCLAW_HOOK_TOKEN> with hooks.token of the gateway (root-only file /root/backups/hook-token.txt on the host).",
                "placeholder": "",
                "source": "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004.config.transform.in.a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002.true.lambda.headers",
                "attrs": {},
                "options": {}
            }
        ]
    }
}
